# A required place of the data that no field of the arguments Structure gives makes the launch refuse with 5 before any
# effect. Answer 3 is for a named field that names no formal only (the decision of Sol 2026-11-25,
# CODER-SMALLFIX-20261125-01). Nothing of the body or of the right sides after the refusal runs: AFTER equals BEFORE.
@: Args (int: other 7)
@: D (
    required: int: seen
    int: other 0
)
@: Code (
    other := 1
)
int: before 0
int: after 0
before := 1
call(Args D Code)
after := 2
